    attachmentId: attachment.id,
  });

  // 5. Fetch the attachment again -- API does not expose 'get', so cannot fully verify not-listed or detailed audit. Instead, simulate business logic: the record should have been set to deleted if viewed by systems that see soft-deleted records.
